Description: Morse Micro FGH100M HaLow (802.11ah) firmware
 Firmware for the Morse Micro MM6108 HaLow chip used on the Wio-WM6108
 module (Quectel FGH100M-H).
 .
 Installs /lib/firmware/morse/mm6108.bin (MM6108 standard firmware) and
 /lib/firmware/morse/bcf_default.bin (Quectel FGH100M-H US BCF board
 configuration), as loaded by the morse-fgh100m-dkms driver.
 Snapshot of MorseMicro/morse-firmware commit 974c7744.
